From f7dc03a2ec23da96c08256b07d3b3e734168832f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Geoff Miller <contributor@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 22:51:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 09/27] perf(mcp): load only context navigation dependencies

Build the combined graph and typed details used by symbol_context without eagerly loading syntax and resolved variants. Scope cold deadlines to those dependencies and name unavailable evidence honestly.

Verified: focused regression RED with three graph builds, corrected focused MCP/memo suite GREEN; package race suite passed before the final wording-only correction. Full canonical gate follows on this clean commit.
